caSlicer's folder on this computer. If OrcaSlicer keeps its settings somewhere else, choose that folder.\" It shows the path it looked in, with Cancel and \"Choose the folder…\".\n\nProposed by the design session, not yet agreed by Kenneth:\n- Printers JusPrin already has show as \"Already in JusPrin\" and are skipped, along with their filaments and processes. Today `plan_orca_import` (`Home/OrcaImport.cpp`) saves a second copy, \"… (Orca copy)\", of any preset whose name JusPrin already has, so a second run would double everything. A preset counts as \"already in JusPrin\" when JusPrin has a preset with the same name and the same `inherits`. A same-named preset with different settings still imports as \"(Orca copy)\", as today.\n- The import from the menu doesn't change the open project's printer. It only adds printers to the printer menu. The first launch still selects one, as it does today.\nEOF\ngrep -c \"Import from OrcaSlicer\" first-run-printer-step-spec-2026-11-05.md"}},"apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011Cgko6Cxqm5mvbc2hDkP82","requestRef":"70d64e68-328e-44eb-bae8-f479f925a50c","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"ccd_turn","attributionMcpTool":"update_plan","type":"assistant","uuid":"4c9400b2-8458-4691-b085-49302e4e3674","timestamp":"2026-11-06T01:20:07.557Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/.claude/projects/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin/figma-mirror","sessionId":"473348c5-5f94-4e4d-9ad9-c7e9dd10b438","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"glimmering-doodling-lovelace"}
