{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"473348c5-5f94-4e4d-9ad9-c7e9dd10b438","id":"97d8748b-f799-46d0-ab5f-202a936123ab","timestamp":"2026-11-06T01:20:24.455Z","version":"2.1.309","querySource":"sdk","shapeHash":"318adc7d46bd3e88aa2b9d30a92d623f0be6da8efb8ec77b24b2e6d0031e31f9","params":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"high"}},"base":"b37c2926-a3b3-4c0c-bb94-5d33684f75d9","keep":155,"tail":["dd6a365eb28f8e0cee98d0cc5db6f0afd21c8567e1f69751656a7d2f742ddf52","95c96c2b41043f7c49880a566a2876f8abb5e6c7999ad38ade0facf7acc10bd5","8d5417819870814c986d7076932ad2dcad28287bdd05a674772b4c6ce5fb42e5"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",157,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"c311b1683c5d6019fff1849134d2533ab82155d879a9c25c81d40992d9a53cf9"}
{"parentUuid":"0468603e-10d1-4592-b8df-3624c8181d10","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgko8jN14MYtSN9Wz4ERB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The \"Import from OrcaSlicer…\" menu item and the dialog it opens are drawn on the canvas (version 111). They're in a new row under Home, titled \"Later, from the File menu: Import from OrcaSlicer…\". The coding session got the build instructions and has started on them. All five boards render correctly in light mode. I checked dark mode on the two main ones, the menu and the printer list, and both look right.\n\nWhat the boards show:\n- **01, the menu:** File › Import, with \"Import from OrcaSlicer…\" as the last item, under OrcaSlicer's own \"Import Configs…\". It's drawn as the macOS menu bar; on Windows and Linux the same menu sits in the window.\n- **02, printers found:** a dialog over the open project. It says \"JusPrin found 2 printers in OrcaSlicer that it doesn't have yet\", followed by the printer list from the first-launch screen.\n  - The A1 mini is greyed out and marked \"Already in JusPrin\".\n  - Below the list are the folder path and \"Choose another folder…\".\n  - The buttons are Cancel and \"Import 2 printers\".\n- **03, after importing:** \"They are in the printer menu. The printer this project uses didn't change.\" It lists what came over and has a Done button.\n- **04, nothing new:** every printer is marked \"Already in JusPrin\" and there's only a Close button.\n- **05, no OrcaSlicer folder:** it says where it looked and offers \"Choose the folder…\".\n\nNone of the first-launch parts are in the dialog: no \"Signed in as…\" line, no Start fresh, no Back.\n\nTwo things in the design are my proposals. You haven't agreed to them yet:\n- **Printers JusPrin already has are skipped.** Today the import saves a second copy named \"… (Orca copy)\" of anything whose name JusPrin already has. From a menu someone can run it twice, and every printer, filament and process would double.\n- **Importing from the menu doesn't switch the open project to an imported printer.** The new printers only appear in the printer menu.\n\nThe spec has a new section for this at the end of [first-run-printer-step-spec-2026-11-05.md](../../../../Projects/JusPrin/first-run-printer-step-spec-2026-11-05.md). PNGs of the boards are in `design-captures/first-run-2026-11/v111/` in the JusPrin checkout."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":399,"cache_read_input_tokens":227146,"output_tokens":778,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":399,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":778,"cache_read_input_tokens":227146,"cache_creation_input_tokens":399,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":399},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cgko8j6cdxNdvcSVbKLXU","requestRef":"97d8748b-f799-46d0-ab5f-202a936123ab","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"ccd_turn","attributionMcpTool":"wrap_up","type":"assistant","uuid":"2cfff433-0d61-4b25-99ad-e0677139a04e","timestamp":"2026-11-06T01:20:32.181Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/.claude/projects/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin/figma-mirror","sessionId":"473348c5-5f94-4e4d-9ad9-c7e9dd10b438","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"glimmering-doodling-lovelace"}
