{"parentUuid":"35a9a42a-fd7e-432b-977c-0647638e8d35","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"7d3fc273-509d-48b6-addd-1491097deda9","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017HnZmbYotQtHQyNAFY3teM","type":"tool_result","content":"(02, 04), because the import as built saves a second copy, “… (Orca copy)”, of anything whose name JusPrin already has. No folder found offers Choose the folder… (05).\n\nProposed, not yet agreed: the import doesn’t change the printer the open project uses (03).","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"b73d4532-eac2-4eba-a912-200f142b9572","timestamp":"2026-11-06T01:37:20.480Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"(02, 04), because the import as built saves a second copy, “… (Orca copy)”, of anything whose name JusPrin already has. No folder found offers Choose the folder… (05).\n\nProposed, not yet agreed: the import doesn’t change the printer the open project uses (03).","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin/first-run-printer-step-spec-2026-11-05.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":92,"oldLines":6,"newStart":92,"newLines":8,"lines":[" - **04. Nothing new.** Every printer is listed as \"Already in JusPrin\". The lead says \"Every printer in this OrcaSlicer folder is already in JusPrin, so there is nothing to import.\" The only buttons are \"Choose another folder…\" and Close."," - **05. No folder found.** \"JusPrin didn't find OrcaSlicer's folder on this computer. If OrcaSlicer keeps its settings somewhere else, choose that folder.\" It shows the path it looked in, with Cancel and \"Choose the folder…\"."," ","-Proposed by the design session, not yet agreed by Kenneth:","+Agreed by Kenneth on 2026-11-05 (\"Yes, keep it\"):"," - Printers JusPrin already has show as \"Already in JusPrin\" and are skipped, along with their filaments and processes. Today `plan_orca_import` (`Home/OrcaImport.cpp`) saves a second copy, \"… (Orca copy)\", of any preset whose name JusPrin already has, so a second run would double everything. A preset counts as \"already in JusPrin\" when JusPrin has a preset with the same name and the same `inherits`. A same-named preset with different settings still imports as \"(Orca copy)\", as today.","+","+Proposed by the design session, not yet agreed by Kenneth:"," - The import from the menu doesn't change the open project's printer. It only adds printers to the printer menu. The first launch still selects one, as it does today."]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin/first-run-printer-step-spec-2026-11-05.md"]}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"35a9a42a-fd7e-432b-977c-0647638e8d35","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/.claude/projects/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin/figma-mirror","sessionId":"473348c5-5f94-4e4d-9ad9-c7e9dd10b438","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"jusprin-newui","slug":"glimmering-doodling-lovelace"}
