{"parentUuid":"1e06fea1-9d47-45df-ae5e-f6327ae66da7","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"ac968909-84f5-42f5-a333-81c2a3e583ec","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012pLjYkeTcYGQiVT2xkv5U6","type":"tool_result","content":"Agreed by Kenneth on 2026-11-05 (\"Yes, keep it\"):\n- Printers JusPrin already has show as \"Already in JusPrin\" and are skipped, along with their filaments and processes. Today `plan_orca_import` (`Home/OrcaImport.cpp`) saves a second copy, \"… (Orca copy)\", of any preset whose name JusPrin already has, so a second run would double everything. A preset counts as \"already in JusPrin\" when JusPrin has a preset with the same name and the same `inherits`. A same-named preset with different settings still imports as \"(Orca copy)\", as today.\n- Agreed the same day (\"Yes, keep it\"): the import from the menu doesn't change the open project's printer. It only adds printers to the printer menu. The first launch still selects one, as it does today.\nbuilt","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"842bc45a-ceff-4dc4-ac80-c56c58df0cb5","timestamp":"2026-11-06T01:37:54.056Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"Agreed by Kenneth on 2026-11-05 (\"Yes, keep it\"):\n- Printers JusPrin already has show as \"Already in JusPrin\" and are skipped, along with their filaments and processes. Today `plan_orca_import` (`Home/OrcaImport.cpp`) saves a second copy, \"… (Orca copy)\", of any preset whose name JusPrin already has, so a second run would double everything. A preset counts as \"already in JusPrin\" when JusPrin has a preset with the same name and the same `inherits`. A same-named preset with different settings still imports as \"(Orca copy)\", as today.\n- Agreed the same day (\"Yes, keep it\"): the import from the menu doesn't change the open project's printer. It only adds printers to the printer menu. The first launch still selects one, as it does today.\nbuilt","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin/first-run-printer-step-spec-2026-11-05.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":94,"oldLines":6,"newStart":94,"newLines":4,"lines":[" "," Agreed by Kenneth on 2026-11-05 (\"Yes, keep it\"):"," - Printers JusPrin already has show as \"Already in JusPrin\" and are skipped, along with their filaments and processes. Today `plan_orca_import` (`Home/OrcaImport.cpp`) saves a second copy, \"… (Orca copy)\", of any preset whose name JusPrin already has, so a second run would double everything. A preset counts as \"already in JusPrin\" when JusPrin has a preset with the same name and the same `inherits`. A same-named preset with different settings still imports as \"(Orca copy)\", as today.","-","-Proposed by the design session, not yet agreed by Kenneth:","-- The import from the menu doesn't change the open project's printer. It only adds printers to the printer menu. The first launch still selects one, as it does today.","+- Agreed the same day (\"Yes, keep it\"): the import from the menu doesn't change the open project's printer. It only adds printers to the printer menu. The first launch still selects one, as it does today."]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin/first-run-printer-step-spec-2026-11-05.md"]}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"1e06fea1-9d47-45df-ae5e-f6327ae66da7","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/.claude/projects/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin/figma-mirror","sessionId":"473348c5-5f94-4e4d-9ad9-c7e9dd10b438","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"jusprin-newui","slug":"glimmering-doodling-lovelace"}
