-probe-live-chat-harness.md) — uncommitted; drives the live chat…\n- [Manual MCP repro](manual-mcp-tool-repro-recipe.md) — --manual-mcp + probe.call, ~20 s…\n- [Settings blacklist](settings-write-blacklist.md) — tools write all but 51 blocked…\n- [Token sync](design-token-sync-decisions.md) — Figma sizes: chip 28, rows 36…; [Design source](design-source-is-claude-artifacts.md) — Claude artifacts; Figma is frozen; [Design artifacts](jusprin-claude-design-system-artifact.md) — source of truth; direct-edit…\n- [Edit questions](orca-edit-questions-forwarded.md) — preview warns…\n- [Chrome extension](claude-in-chrome-lives-in-claude-profile.md) — needs a Chrome Profile 20 window.\n- [Deferral commit](jusprin-newui-deferral-commit-removed.md) — 491b56d26b only on…\n- [No tool approval](tool-call-approval-removed.md) — valid calls start at once; never…\n- [Ask AI = Resolve](ask-ai-same-tools-as-resolve.md) — same tools, only the sentence…\n- [Orca MessageDialog](use-orca-messagedialog.md) — never wxMessageDialog; file opens…\n- [Action id collision](printer-panel-action-id-collision.md) — t-1 restart → false…\n- [Previews skip validate](printer-setup-bed-type-check.md) — Print::validate runs only at…\n- [Rare failures](rare-failures-get-a-generic-error.md) — one generic error, no per-cause…\n- [Tool result states](tool-result-states-method.md) — Kenneth’s test: a person stuck…\n- [Forward the real error](forward-the-real-error-four-rules.md) — four rules for false results; no…\n- [Prompt sections](project-prompt-sections.md) — five sections; policy out of tool…; [Rule placement](rule-lives-next-to-what-it-governs.md) — one-tool rules in description…; [Prompt channels](prompt-principles-vs-state-channels.md) — standing prompt = principles; the…\n- [History trimming](history-trimming-by-size.md) — 64 KiB budget in three stages.\n- [Input tags](workspace-input-tags.md) — user message parts with…\n- [Print-setup cases](print-setup-prompt-cases.md) — print-this-no-purpose; reco