{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"473348c5-5f94-4e4d-9ad9-c7e9dd10b438","hash":"512eabf22b3cd9c8e070a01f059de1873f611f6f07853fb115280699878c7030","message":{"role":"system","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Plain output style is active. Remember to follow the specific guidelines for this style.\n\nNote: /Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin/.claude/worktrees/first-run-flow-f7be35/src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin/HomeUI/src/components/Onboarding.tsx was read before the last conversation was summarized, but the contents are too large to include. Use Read tool if you need to access it.\n\nBackground shell b91lho65z (\"W=/private/tmp/claude/claude-502/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin/473348c5-5f94-4e4d-9ad9-c7e9dd10b438/scratchpad/walk; cd $W && exec python3 server.py 8765 $W/page $W/snaps\") is still running (command, shown on one line: `W=/private/tmp/claude/claude-502/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin/473348c5-5f94-4e4d-9ad9-c7e9dd10b438/scratchpad/walk; cd $W && exec python3 server.py 8765 $W/page $W/snaps`). Do not start it again; to restart it, stop it with TaskStop first. You can read its output at /private/tmp/claude/claude-502/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin/473348c5-5f94-4e4d-9ad9-c7e9dd10b438/tasks/b91lho65z.output.\n\nBackground shell bkpz3bmyq (\"W=/private/tmp/claude/claude-502/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin/473348c5-5f94-4e4d-9ad9-c7e9dd10b438/scratchpad/walk; cd $W && rm -rf a/JusPrin2 && mkdir a/JusPrin2 && JUSPRIN_HOME_DEV_URL=http://127… [+190 chars]\") is still running (command, shown on one line: `W=/private/tmp/claude/claude-502/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin/473348c5-5f94-4e4d-9ad9-c7e9dd10b438/scratchpad/walk; cd $W && rm -rf a/JusPrin2 && mkdir a/JusPrin2 && JUSPRIN_HOME_DEV_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8765/home.html JUSPRIN_AGENT_ENDPOINT=https://jusprinv2-stg.obico.io/ent/jusprin/v2/responses exec $W/JusPrinWalk.app/Contents/MacOS/OrcaSlicer --datadir $W/a/JusPrin2 > $W/a.out 2>&1`). Do not start it again; to restart it, stop it with TaskStop first. You can read its output at /private/tmp/claude/claude-502/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin/473348c5-5f94-4e4d-9ad9-c7e9dd10b438/tasks/bkpz3bmyq.output.\n\nThe following deferred tools are now available via ToolSearch. Their schemas are NOT loaded — calling them directly will fail with InputValidationError. Use ToolSearch with query \"select:<name>[,<name>...]\" to load tool schemas before calling them:\nArtifactComments\nArtifactData\nCronCreate\nCronDelete\nCronList\nDesignSync\nEnterPlanMode\nEnterWorktree\nExitPlanMode\nExitWorktree\nListMcpResourcesTool\nListPlugins\nListSkills\nMonitor\nNotebookEdit\nPushNotification\nReadMcpResourceDirTool\nReadMcpResourceTool\nRemoteTrigger\nSearchSkills\nSendMessage\nTaskStop\nWebFetch\nWebSearch\nmcp__1a59c906-04da-521d-bda7-7f71b9f9e01c__create\nmcp__1a59c906-04da-521d-bda7-7f71b9f9e01c__delete\nmcp__1a59c906-04da-521d-bda7-7f71b9f9e01c__export\nmcp__1a59c906-04da-521d-bda7-7f71b9f9e01c__query\nmcp__1a59c906-04da-521d-bda7-7f71b9f9e01c__read\nmcp__6d1092c0-9521-478c-803f-a5a5d76eedd7__fetch\nmcp__6d1092c0-9521-478c-803f-a5a5d76eedd7__list_tags\nmcp__6d1092c0-9521-478c-803f-a5a5d76eedd7__search\nmcp__80b2b8bf-408b-48cd-ac08-73e36beb51fd__apply_sensitive_message_label\nmcp__80b2b8bf-408b-48cd-ac08-73e36beb51fd__apply_sensitive_thread_label\nmcp__80b2b8bf-408b-48cd-ac08-73e36beb51fd__create_draft\nmcp__80b2b8bf-408b-48cd-ac08-73e36beb51fd__create_label\nmcp__80b2b8bf-408b-48cd-ac08-73e36beb51fd__delete_draft\nmcp__80b2b8bf-408b-48cd-ac08-73e36beb51fd__delete_label\nmcp__80b2b8bf-408b-48cd-ac08-73e36beb51fd__forward\nmcp__80b2b8bf-408b-48cd-ac08-73e36beb51fd__get_draft\nmcp__80b2b8bf-408b-48cd-ac08-73e36beb51fd__get_message\nmcp__80b2b8bf-408b-48cd-ac08-73e36beb51fd__get_thread\nmcp__80b2b8bf-408b-48cd-ac08-73e36beb51fd__label_message\nmcp__80b2b8bf-408b-48cd-ac08-73e36beb51fd__label_thread\nmcp__80b2b8bf-408b-48cd-ac08-73e36beb51fd__list_drafts\nmcp__80b2b8bf-408b-48cd-ac08-73e36beb51fd__list_labels\nmcp__80b2b8bf-408b-48cd-ac08-73e36beb