{"parentUuid":"85cfa648-9fab-4c68-be15-3cd77729f51c","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"4066a539-df02-4a4b-a252-ce34d4e29061","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011dCCnKisRHkzGeiUjJ6mr4","type":"tool_result","content":"credits-open For Kenneth, drawn as written in the doc but not settled.\nThe Thinking picker stays on Expert only (Kenneth, 2026-11-02) with the levels JusPrin’s alias offers today, Fast and Thorough. The plan doesn’t say whether Thorough costs more; drawn at one price. \n\ncredits-wording Wording and placeholders that are mine, not the doc’s: “Sign in for 500 credits” on the offer’s button, and the doc’s pitch split into a headline and a detail line; “5 credits a message” for the doc’s “5 credits”; the tooltip’s wording on 2c; “Bought credits” as that lot’s name; “Get more credits” replacing Buy credits and Subscribe outside the pricing page; the total behind the composer’s ring, which is every credit in the balance when each kind started, a placeholder rule; the JusPrin v1 lines on 1c and 1d; the report form’s copy; 31 Jan as the launch end date; “Workshop credits” as the name of that lot. Not drawn: dark Prepare (its viewport is a light screenshot). A JusPrin v1 subscriber moves to Hobby at their original price (Kenneth, 2026-11-02); the implementation plan still says Workshop until term end.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"ca9a00f6-bfd1-41f0-9a2b-47180be1053f","timestamp":"2026-11-06T13:37:17.198Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"credits-open For Kenneth, drawn as written in the doc but not settled.\nThe Thinking picker stays on Expert only (Kenneth, 2026-11-02) with the levels JusPrin’s alias offers today, Fast and Thorough. The plan doesn’t say whether Thorough costs more; drawn at one price. \n\ncredits-wording Wording and placeholders that are mine, not the doc’s: “Sign in for 500 credits” on the offer’s button, and the doc’s pitch split into a headline and a detail line; “5 credits a message” for the doc’s “5 credits”; the tooltip’s wording on 2c; “Bought credits” as that lot’s name; “Get more credits” replacing Buy credits and Subscribe outside the pricing page; the total behind the composer’s ring, which is every credit in the balance when each kind started, a placeholder rule; the JusPrin v1 lines on 1c and 1d; the report form’s copy; 31 Jan as the launch end date; “Workshop credits” as the name of that lot. Not drawn: dark Prepare (its viewport is a light screenshot). A JusPrin v1 subscriber moves to Hobby at their original price (Kenneth, 2026-11-02); the implementation plan still says Workshop until term end.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"85cfa648-9fab-4c68-be15-3cd77729f51c","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/tsd-enterprise","sessionId":"473348c5-5f94-4e4d-9ad9-c7e9dd10b438","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"jusprin-newui","slug":"glimmering-doodling-lovelace"}
