ing anything that makes external browser the superior decision that only genius like you can see? Second, it does not make sense to double only the pay as you go for the launch offer. Also, I agree that pay as you go may not be the best name for credit purchase. Can you think of a better term?"}]},"uuid":"727217b9-e486-47bb-9839-87e16b3a9578","timestamp":"2026-11-06T14:42:05.161Z","permissionMode":"bypassPermissions","origin":{"kind":"human"},"promptSource":"sdk","turnOrigin":"human","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":21,"turnIndex":32},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin","sessionId":"473348c5-5f94-4e4d-9ad9-c7e9dd10b438","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"jusprin-newui","slug":"glimmering-doodling-lovelace"}
