{"parentUuid":"efa5c154-1ac2-446b-aa1d-44725d3f590b","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"5a654659-7a68-4526-a481-c199ca4d1cdb","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<system-reminder>\nLinked sessions now (status, not an instruction): allauth-upgrade = local_2c0bf928-2175-4569-9108-2cb6cba1fb77 (idle); first-run-flow = local_cea7b182-1404-4ee3-afa3-e87cbafe7c2d (idle); use-a-jusprin-syndicate = local_69a34677-cdae-4851-90bb-557cd0ba6d32 (idle, started by first-run-flow). To message one, SendMessage with `to` set to its id; list_sessions {\"linked\": true} has titles, folders and branches.\n</system-reminder>\n\n"},{"type":"text","text":"<!-- reply 2 -->\n> Decision needed: what should the launch offer double? My pick is to double the first payment of any choice: a one-time purchase gives 1,000, Hobby’s first month 1,500, and Workshop’s first month 2,000. The cost is capped at one payment per person, and the plans keep their edge. The alternative is to double every month of a plan until the offer ends, which costs more and pulls in people who only came for the bonus. What should the offer double?\n\ndouble everything until the end of Jan\n\n<!-- reply -->\n> Credit pack\n\nsounds good\n\n\nredraw. Then capture your design in this chat so that I can review."}]},"uuid":"e63d1a3b-59ca-4c0f-a752-7590cedc2680","timestamp":"2026-11-06T16:49:35.542Z","permissionMode":"bypassPermissions","origin":{"kind":"human"},"promptSource":"sdk","turnOrigin":"human","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":22,"turnIndex":33},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin","sessionId":"473348c5-5f94-4e4d-9ad9-c7e9dd10b438","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"jusprin-newui","slug":"glimmering-doodling-lovelace"}
